{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Groq adapter provides access to Groq's fast inference API, featuring the world's fastest LLM inference and Whisper-based audio transcription."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager","mode":"install"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-groq\"]],\"vue\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-groq\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-groq\"]],\"svelte\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-groq\"]],\"preact\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-groq\"]],\"angular\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-groq\"]],\"vanilla\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-groq\"]],\"octane\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-groq\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"basic-usage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic Usage"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"basic-usage-custom-api-key","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic Usage - Custom API Key"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createGroqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst adapter = createGroqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\", process.env.GROQ_API_KEY!, {\n  // ... your config options\n});\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createGroqText, type GroqTextConfig } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst config: Omit<GroqTextConfig, 'apiKey'> = {\n  baseURL: \"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\", // Optional, for custom endpoints\n};\n\nconst adapter = createGroqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\", process.env.GROQ_API_KEY!, config);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example-chat-completion","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example: Chat Completion"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat, toServerSentEventsResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { messages } = await request.json();\n\n  const stream = chat({\n    adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n    messages,\n  });\n\n  return toServerSentEventsResponse(stream);\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example-with-tools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example: With Tools"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat, toolDefinition, type ModelMessage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nconst searchDatabaseDef = toolDefinition({\n  name: \"search_database\",\n  description: \"Search the database\",\n  inputSchema: z.object({\n    query: z.string(),\n  }),\n});\n\nconst searchDatabase = searchDatabaseDef.server(async ({ query }) => {\n  // Search database\n  return { results: [] };\n});\n\nconst messages: Array<ModelMessage> = [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Search for something\" }];\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  messages,\n  tools: [searchDatabase],\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If Groq rejects a generated tool call with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tool_use_failed"},{"type":"text","value":" and includes a reconstructable tool call in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"failed_generation"},{"type":"text","value":", the adapter returns the provider error as that tool's result without executing the call. The agent loop can then repair the call on its next iteration. Other provider errors remain terminal run errors."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"transcription","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Transcription"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Groq exposes Whisper-based speech-to-text via "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"groqTranscription()"},{"type":"text","value":" and the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"generateTranscription()"},{"type":"text","value":" activity. The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"audio"},{"type":"text","value":" input accepts a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"File"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Blob"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"text","value":", base64 string, data URL, or an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"https://"},{"type":"text","value":" URL (forwarded directly to Groq without re-uploading)."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateTranscription } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqTranscription } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter: groqTranscription(\"whisper-large-v3-turbo\"),\n  audio: \"https://example.com/recording.mp3\",\n  language: \"en\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.text);\n\n// verbose_json (the default) populates language, duration, and timestamped segments\nfor (const segment of result.segments ?? []) {\n  console.log(`[${segment.start}s → ${segment.end}s] ${segment.text}`);\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Supported models: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"whisper-large-v3-turbo"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"whisper-large-v3"},{"type":"text","value":". Supported "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"responseFormat"},{"type":"text","value":" values: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"json"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"text"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"verbose_json"},{"type":"text","value":" (default). "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"srt"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vtt"},{"type":"text","value":" are not supported by Groq."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See "},{"type":"link","href":"../media/transcription","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Transcription"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for the full API."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"model-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Model Options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Groq supports various provider-specific options. Sampling parameters live here too — "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"temperature"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"top_p"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"max_completion_tokens"},{"type":"text","value":" (Groq's token-limit key) — rather than as root-level props on "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chat()"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n  modelOptions: {\n    temperature: 0.7,\n    max_completion_tokens: 1024,\n    top_p: 0.9,\n  },\n});","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you previously passed "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"temperature"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"topP"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"maxTokens"},{"type":"text","value":" at the root of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chat()"},{"type":"text","value":", see "},{"type":"link","href":"../migration/sampling-options-to-model-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Moving Sampling Options into modelOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"reasoning","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reasoning"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Enable reasoning for models that support it (e.g., "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"openai/gpt-oss-120b"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"qwen/qwen3-32b"},{"type":"text","value":"). This allows the model to show its reasoning process, which is streamed as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"thinking"},{"type":"text","value":" chunks:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"modelOptions: {\n  reasoning_effort: \"medium\", // \"none\" | \"default\" | \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\"\n}","lang":"typescript","meta":"ignore"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"summarization","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Summarization"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Summarize long text content:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { summarize } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqSummarize } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst result = await summarize({\n  adapter: groqSummarize(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  text: \"Your long text to summarize...\",\n  maxLength: 100,\n  style: \"concise\", // \"concise\" | \"bullet-points\" | \"paragraph\"\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.summary);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"supported-models","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Supported Models"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Groq offers a diverse selection of models from multiple providers:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"meta-llama","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Meta Llama"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"llama-3.3-70b-versatile"},{"type":"text","value":" - Fast, capable model with 128K context"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"llama-3.1-8b-instant"},{"type":"text","value":" - Fast, cost-effective model"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"meta-llama/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct"},{"type":"text","value":" - Latest Llama 4 with vision support"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"meta-llama/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct"},{"type":"text","value":" - Efficient Llama 4 model"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"security-models","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Security Models"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"meta-llama/llama-guard-4-12b"},{"type":"text","value":" - Content moderation"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"meta-llama/llama-prompt-guard-2-86m"},{"type":"text","value":" - Prompt injection detection"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"meta-llama/llama-prompt-guard-2-22m"},{"type":"text","value":" - Lightweight prompt guard"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"openai-gpt-oss-models","children":[{"type":"text","value":"OpenAI GPT-OSS Models"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"openai/gpt-oss-120b"},{"type":"text","value":" - Large OSS model with reasoning support"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"openai/gpt-oss-20b"},{"type":"text","value":" - Efficient OSS model"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"openai/gpt-oss-safeguard-20b"},{"type":"text","value":" - Safety-tuned OSS model"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"other-providers","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Other Providers"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"moonshotai/kimi-k2-instruct-0905"},{"type":"text","value":" - Kimi K2 with 256K context"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"qwen/qwen3-32b"},{"type":"text","value":" - Qwen 3 with reasoning support"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"environment-variables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Environment Variables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set your API key in environment variables:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"api-reference","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API Reference"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"groqtext-model-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"groqText(model, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Groq chat adapter using environment variables."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"model"},{"type":"text","value":" - The model name (e.g., "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"llama-3.3-70b-versatile"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config"},{"type":"text","value":" (optional) - Optional configuration object. Supports the same options as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGroqText"},{"type":"text","value":" except "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"apiKey"},{"type":"text","value":", which is auto-detected from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"GROQ_API_KEY"},{"type":"text","value":" environment variable. Common options:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"baseURL"},{"type":"text","value":" - Custom base URL for API requests (optional)"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A Groq chat adapter instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"creategroqtext-model-apikey-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGroqText(model, apiKey, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Groq chat adapter with an explicit API key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"model"},{"type":"text","value":" - The model name (e.g., "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"llama-3.3-70b-versatile"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"apiKey"},{"type":"text","value":" - Your Groq API key"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config"},{"type":"text","value":" (optional) - Optional configuration object:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"baseURL"},{"type":"text","value":" - Custom base URL for API requests (optional)"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A Groq chat adapter instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"groqsummarize-model-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"groqSummarize(model, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Groq summarization adapter using environment variables."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A Groq summarize adapter instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"creategroqsummarize-model-apikey-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGroqSummarize(model, apiKey, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Groq summarization adapter with an explicit API key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" A Groq summarize adapter instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"groqtranscription-model-config-creategroqtranscription-model-apikey-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"groqTranscription(model, config?)"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createGroqTranscription(model, apiKey, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Groq transcription (speech-to-text) adapter. The short form reads "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"GROQ_API_KEY"},{"type":"text","value":" from the environment; the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"create*"},{"type":"text","value":" form takes an explicit API key. Supported models: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"whisper-large-v3-turbo"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"whisper-large-v3"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"limitations","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Limitations"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Text-to-Speech"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Groq does not currently expose a TTS adapter. Use OpenAI, Gemini, ElevenLabs, or fal for speech generation."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image Generation"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Groq does not support image generation. Use OpenAI, Gemini, or fal for image generation."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"next-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next Steps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../getting-started/quick-start","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Getting Started"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Learn the basics"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../tools/tools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tools Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Learn about tools"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./openai","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Other Adapters"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Explore other providers"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"provider-tools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider Tools"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Groq does not currently expose provider-specific tool factories.\nDefine your own tools with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toolDefinition()"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See "},{"type":"link","href":"../tools/tools.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for the general tool-definition flow, or\n"},{"type":"link","href":"../tools/provider-tools.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider Tools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for other providers'\nnative-tool offerings."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"basic-usage","text":"Basic Usage","level":2},{"id":"basic-usage-custom-api-key","text":"Basic Usage - Custom API Key","level":2},{"id":"configuration","text":"Configuration","level":2},{"id":"example-chat-completion","text":"Example: Chat Completion","level":2},{"id":"example-with-tools","text":"Example: With Tools","level":2},{"id":"transcription","text":"Transcription","level":2},{"id":"model-options","text":"Model Options","level":2},{"id":"reasoning","text":"Reasoning","level":3},{"id":"summarization","text":"Summarization","level":2},{"id":"supported-models","text":"Supported Models","level":2},{"id":"meta-llama","text":"Meta Llama","level":3},{"id":"security-models","text":"Security Models","level":3},{"id":"openai-gpt-oss-models","text":"OpenAI GPT-OSS Models","level":3},{"id":"other-providers","text":"Other Providers","level":3},{"id":"environment-variables","text":"Environment Variables","level":2},{"id":"api-reference","text":"API Reference","level":2},{"id":"groqtext-model-config","text":"groqText(model, config?)","level":3},{"id":"creategroqtext-model-apikey-config","text":"createGroqText(model, apiKey, config?)","level":3},{"id":"groqsummarize-model-config","text":"groqSummarize(model, config?)","level":3},{"id":"creategroqsummarize-model-apikey-config","text":"createGroqSummarize(model, apiKey, config?)","level":3},{"id":"groqtranscription-model-config-creategroqtranscription-model-apikey-config","text":"groqTranscription(model, config?) / createGroqTranscription(model, apiKey, config?)","level":3},{"id":"limitations","text":"Limitations","level":2},{"id":"next-steps","text":"Next Steps","level":2},{"id":"provider-tools","text":"Provider Tools","level":2}]},"frameworks":["react","vue","solid","svelte","preact","angular","vanilla","octane"],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe Groq adapter provides access to Groq's fast inference API, featuring the world's fastest LLM inference and Whisper-based audio transcription.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/ai-groq\nvue: @tanstack/ai-groq\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-groq\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-groq\npreact: @tanstack/ai-groq\nangular: @tanstack/ai-groq\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-groq\noctane: @tanstack/ai-groq\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n```\n\n## Basic Usage - Custom API Key\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createGroqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst adapter = createGroqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\", process.env.GROQ_API_KEY!, {\n  // ... your config options\n});\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```typescript\nimport { createGroqText, type GroqTextConfig } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst config: Omit<GroqTextConfig, 'apiKey'> = {\n  baseURL: \"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\", // Optional, for custom endpoints\n};\n\nconst adapter = createGroqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\", process.env.GROQ_API_KEY!, config);\n```\n\n## Example: Chat Completion\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toServerSentEventsResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { messages } = await request.json();\n\n  const stream = chat({\n    adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n    messages,\n  });\n\n  return toServerSentEventsResponse(stream);\n}\n```\n\n## Example: With Tools\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toolDefinition, type ModelMessage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nconst searchDatabaseDef = toolDefinition({\n  name: \"search_database\",\n  description: \"Search the database\",\n  inputSchema: z.object({\n    query: z.string(),\n  }),\n});\n\nconst searchDatabase = searchDatabaseDef.server(async ({ query }) => {\n  // Search database\n  return { results: [] };\n});\n\nconst messages: Array<ModelMessage> = [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Search for something\" }];\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  messages,\n  tools: [searchDatabase],\n});\n```\n\nIf Groq rejects a generated tool call with `tool_use_failed` and includes a reconstructable tool call in `failed_generation`, the adapter returns the provider error as that tool's result without executing the call. The agent loop can then repair the call on its next iteration. Other provider errors remain terminal run errors.\n\n## Transcription\n\nGroq exposes Whisper-based speech-to-text via `groqTranscription()` and the `generateTranscription()` activity. The `audio` input accepts a `File`, `Blob`, `ArrayBuffer`, base64 string, data URL, or an `https://` URL (forwarded directly to Groq without re-uploading).\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateTranscription } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqTranscription } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter: groqTranscription(\"whisper-large-v3-turbo\"),\n  audio: \"https://example.com/recording.mp3\",\n  language: \"en\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.text);\n\n// verbose_json (the default) populates language, duration, and timestamped segments\nfor (const segment of result.segments ?? []) {\n  console.log(`[${segment.start}s → ${segment.end}s] ${segment.text}`);\n}\n```\n\nSupported models: `whisper-large-v3-turbo`, `whisper-large-v3`. Supported `responseFormat` values: `json`, `text`, `verbose_json` (default). `srt` and `vtt` are not supported by Groq.\n\nSee [Transcription](../media/transcription) for the full API.\n\n## Model Options\n\nGroq supports various provider-specific options. Sampling parameters live here too — `temperature`, `top_p`, and `max_completion_tokens` (Groq's token-limit key) — rather than as root-level props on `chat()`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n  modelOptions: {\n    temperature: 0.7,\n    max_completion_tokens: 1024,\n    top_p: 0.9,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n> If you previously passed `temperature` / `topP` / `maxTokens` at the root of `chat()`, see [Moving Sampling Options into modelOptions](../migration/sampling-options-to-model-options).\n\n### Reasoning\n\nEnable reasoning for models that support it (e.g., `openai/gpt-oss-120b`, `qwen/qwen3-32b`). This allows the model to show its reasoning process, which is streamed as `thinking` chunks:\n\n```typescript ignore\nmodelOptions: {\n  reasoning_effort: \"medium\", // \"none\" | \"default\" | \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\"\n}\n```\n\n## Summarization\n\nSummarize long text content:\n\n```typescript\nimport { summarize } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqSummarize } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst result = await summarize({\n  adapter: groqSummarize(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  text: \"Your long text to summarize...\",\n  maxLength: 100,\n  style: \"concise\", // \"concise\" | \"bullet-points\" | \"paragraph\"\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.summary);\n```\n\n## Supported Models\n\nGroq offers a diverse selection of models from multiple providers:\n\n### Meta Llama\n\n- `llama-3.3-70b-versatile` - Fast, capable model with 128K context\n- `llama-3.1-8b-instant` - Fast, cost-effective model\n- `meta-llama/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct` - Latest Llama 4 with vision support\n- `meta-llama/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct` - Efficient Llama 4 model\n\n### Security Models\n\n- `meta-llama/llama-guard-4-12b` - Content moderation\n- `meta-llama/llama-prompt-guard-2-86m` - Prompt injection detection\n- `meta-llama/llama-prompt-guard-2-22m` - Lightweight prompt guard\n\n### OpenAI GPT-OSS Models\n\n- `openai/gpt-oss-120b` - Large OSS model with reasoning support\n- `openai/gpt-oss-20b` - Efficient OSS model\n- `openai/gpt-oss-safeguard-20b` - Safety-tuned OSS model\n\n### Other Providers\n\n- `moonshotai/kimi-k2-instruct-0905` - Kimi K2 with 256K context\n- `qwen/qwen3-32b` - Qwen 3 with reasoning support\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nSet your API key in environment variables:\n\n```bash\nGROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `groqText(model, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq chat adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - The model name (e.g., `llama-3.3-70b-versatile`)\n- `config` (optional) - Optional configuration object. Supports the same options as `createGroqText` except `apiKey`, which is auto-detected from `GROQ_API_KEY` environment variable. Common options:\n  - `baseURL` - Custom base URL for API requests (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Groq chat adapter instance.\n\n### `createGroqText(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq chat adapter with an explicit API key.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - The model name (e.g., `llama-3.3-70b-versatile`)\n- `apiKey` - Your Groq API key\n- `config` (optional) - Optional configuration object:\n  - `baseURL` - Custom base URL for API requests (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Groq chat adapter instance.\n\n### `groqSummarize(model, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq summarization adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Returns:** A Groq summarize adapter instance.\n\n### `createGroqSummarize(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq summarization adapter with an explicit API key.\n\n**Returns:** A Groq summarize adapter instance.\n\n### `groqTranscription(model, config?)` / `createGroqTranscription(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq transcription (speech-to-text) adapter. The short form reads `GROQ_API_KEY` from the environment; the `create*` form takes an explicit API key. Supported models: `whisper-large-v3-turbo`, `whisper-large-v3`.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- **Text-to-Speech**: Groq does not currently expose a TTS adapter. Use OpenAI, Gemini, ElevenLabs, or fal for speech generation.\n- **Image Generation**: Groq does not support image generation. Use OpenAI, Gemini, or fal for image generation.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Getting Started](../getting-started/quick-start) - Learn the basics\n- [Tools Guide](../tools/tools) - Learn about tools\n- [Other Adapters](./openai) - Explore other providers\n\n## Provider Tools\n\nGroq does not currently expose provider-specific tool factories.\nDefine your own tools with `toolDefinition()` from `@tanstack/ai`.\n\nSee [Tools](../tools/tools.md) for the general tool-definition flow, or\n[Provider Tools](../tools/provider-tools.md) for other providers'\nnative-tool offerings.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Groq\nid: groq-adapter\norder: 6\ndescription: \"Use Groq's fast inference API with TanStack AI for low-latency LLM responses and Whisper transcription — Llama and other open-weight models via @tanstack/ai-groq.\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - groq\n  - fast inference\n  - llama\n  - low latency\n  - adapter\n  - llm\n  - whisper\n  - transcription\n---\n\nThe Groq adapter provides access to Groq's fast inference API, featuring the world's fastest LLM inference and Whisper-based audio transcription.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/ai-groq\nvue: @tanstack/ai-groq\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-groq\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-groq\npreact: @tanstack/ai-groq\nangular: @tanstack/ai-groq\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-groq\noctane: @tanstack/ai-groq\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n```\n\n## Basic Usage - Custom API Key\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { createGroqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst adapter = createGroqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\", process.env.GROQ_API_KEY!, {\n  // ... your config options\n});\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n});\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```typescript\nimport { createGroqText, type GroqTextConfig } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst config: Omit<GroqTextConfig, 'apiKey'> = {\n  baseURL: \"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\", // Optional, for custom endpoints\n};\n\nconst adapter = createGroqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\", process.env.GROQ_API_KEY!, config);\n```\n\n## Example: Chat Completion\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toServerSentEventsResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { messages } = await request.json();\n\n  const stream = chat({\n    adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n    messages,\n  });\n\n  return toServerSentEventsResponse(stream);\n}\n```\n\n## Example: With Tools\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toolDefinition, type ModelMessage } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nconst searchDatabaseDef = toolDefinition({\n  name: \"search_database\",\n  description: \"Search the database\",\n  inputSchema: z.object({\n    query: z.string(),\n  }),\n});\n\nconst searchDatabase = searchDatabaseDef.server(async ({ query }) => {\n  // Search database\n  return { results: [] };\n});\n\nconst messages: Array<ModelMessage> = [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Search for something\" }];\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  messages,\n  tools: [searchDatabase],\n});\n```\n\nIf Groq rejects a generated tool call with `tool_use_failed` and includes a reconstructable tool call in `failed_generation`, the adapter returns the provider error as that tool's result without executing the call. The agent loop can then repair the call on its next iteration. Other provider errors remain terminal run errors.\n\n## Transcription\n\nGroq exposes Whisper-based speech-to-text via `groqTranscription()` and the `generateTranscription()` activity. The `audio` input accepts a `File`, `Blob`, `ArrayBuffer`, base64 string, data URL, or an `https://` URL (forwarded directly to Groq without re-uploading).\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateTranscription } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqTranscription } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter: groqTranscription(\"whisper-large-v3-turbo\"),\n  audio: \"https://example.com/recording.mp3\",\n  language: \"en\",\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.text);\n\n// verbose_json (the default) populates language, duration, and timestamped segments\nfor (const segment of result.segments ?? []) {\n  console.log(`[${segment.start}s → ${segment.end}s] ${segment.text}`);\n}\n```\n\nSupported models: `whisper-large-v3-turbo`, `whisper-large-v3`. Supported `responseFormat` values: `json`, `text`, `verbose_json` (default). `srt` and `vtt` are not supported by Groq.\n\nSee [Transcription](../media/transcription) for the full API.\n\n## Model Options\n\nGroq supports various provider-specific options. Sampling parameters live here too — `temperature`, `top_p`, and `max_completion_tokens` (Groq's token-limit key) — rather than as root-level props on `chat()`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqText } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: groqText(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello!\" }],\n  modelOptions: {\n    temperature: 0.7,\n    max_completion_tokens: 1024,\n    top_p: 0.9,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n> If you previously passed `temperature` / `topP` / `maxTokens` at the root of `chat()`, see [Moving Sampling Options into modelOptions](../migration/sampling-options-to-model-options).\n\n### Reasoning\n\nEnable reasoning for models that support it (e.g., `openai/gpt-oss-120b`, `qwen/qwen3-32b`). This allows the model to show its reasoning process, which is streamed as `thinking` chunks:\n\n```typescript ignore\nmodelOptions: {\n  reasoning_effort: \"medium\", // \"none\" | \"default\" | \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\"\n}\n```\n\n## Summarization\n\nSummarize long text content:\n\n```typescript\nimport { summarize } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { groqSummarize } from \"@tanstack/ai-groq\";\n\nconst result = await summarize({\n  adapter: groqSummarize(\"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\"),\n  text: \"Your long text to summarize...\",\n  maxLength: 100,\n  style: \"concise\", // \"concise\" | \"bullet-points\" | \"paragraph\"\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.summary);\n```\n\n## Supported Models\n\nGroq offers a diverse selection of models from multiple providers:\n\n### Meta Llama\n\n- `llama-3.3-70b-versatile` - Fast, capable model with 128K context\n- `llama-3.1-8b-instant` - Fast, cost-effective model\n- `meta-llama/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct` - Latest Llama 4 with vision support\n- `meta-llama/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct` - Efficient Llama 4 model\n\n### Security Models\n\n- `meta-llama/llama-guard-4-12b` - Content moderation\n- `meta-llama/llama-prompt-guard-2-86m` - Prompt injection detection\n- `meta-llama/llama-prompt-guard-2-22m` - Lightweight prompt guard\n\n### OpenAI GPT-OSS Models\n\n- `openai/gpt-oss-120b` - Large OSS model with reasoning support\n- `openai/gpt-oss-20b` - Efficient OSS model\n- `openai/gpt-oss-safeguard-20b` - Safety-tuned OSS model\n\n### Other Providers\n\n- `moonshotai/kimi-k2-instruct-0905` - Kimi K2 with 256K context\n- `qwen/qwen3-32b` - Qwen 3 with reasoning support\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nSet your API key in environment variables:\n\n```bash\nGROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `groqText(model, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq chat adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - The model name (e.g., `llama-3.3-70b-versatile`)\n- `config` (optional) - Optional configuration object. Supports the same options as `createGroqText` except `apiKey`, which is auto-detected from `GROQ_API_KEY` environment variable. Common options:\n  - `baseURL` - Custom base URL for API requests (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Groq chat adapter instance.\n\n### `createGroqText(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq chat adapter with an explicit API key.\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n- `model` - The model name (e.g., `llama-3.3-70b-versatile`)\n- `apiKey` - Your Groq API key\n- `config` (optional) - Optional configuration object:\n  - `baseURL` - Custom base URL for API requests (optional)\n\n**Returns:** A Groq chat adapter instance.\n\n### `groqSummarize(model, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq summarization adapter using environment variables.\n\n**Returns:** A Groq summarize adapter instance.\n\n### `createGroqSummarize(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq summarization adapter with an explicit API key.\n\n**Returns:** A Groq summarize adapter instance.\n\n### `groqTranscription(model, config?)` / `createGroqTranscription(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nCreates a Groq transcription (speech-to-text) adapter. The short form reads `GROQ_API_KEY` from the environment; the `create*` form takes an explicit API key. Supported models: `whisper-large-v3-turbo`, `whisper-large-v3`.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- **Text-to-Speech**: Groq does not currently expose a TTS adapter. Use OpenAI, Gemini, ElevenLabs, or fal for speech generation.\n- **Image Generation**: Groq does not support image generation. Use OpenAI, Gemini, or fal for image generation.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Getting Started](../getting-started/quick-start) - Learn the basics\n- [Tools Guide](../tools/tools) - Learn about tools\n- [Other Adapters](./openai) - Explore other providers\n\n## Provider Tools\n\nGroq does not currently expose provider-specific tool factories.\nDefine your own tools with `toolDefinition()` from `@tanstack/ai`.\n\nSee [Tools](../tools/tools.md) for the general tool-definition flow, or\n[Provider Tools](../tools/provider-tools.md) for other providers'\nnative-tool offerings.\n"}
